OL,3,GNEWSAHow climate change is reshaping
OL,4,ABritain's trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's biggest tree nurseries
OL,7,Fsays it is already changing the species
OL,8,Fit grows as hotter, drier summers
OL,9,Freshape conditions for growers.
OL,11,FFrank P Matthews, based in Tenbury
OL,12,FWells, Worcestershire, produces more
OL,13,Fthan a million trees every year,
OL,14,Fsupplying garden centres across the
OL,15,Fcountry.
OL,17,FAfter what it describes as a
OL,18,Fchallenging growing season, the
OL,19,Ffamily-run business has introduced new
OL,20,Fdrought-tolerant species, reduced water
OL,21,Fuse and adapted the way it irrigates
OL,22,Fits trees.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
